# Corporate / site workspace separation

Corporate program state and this site checkout are separate Cursor workspaces.
Never call `move_agent_to_root` to the corporate folder from here (or ask a
corporate chat to move here). If the workspace is the wrong plane, stop and
ask the user to open the other folder. Do not stash the other git root.
